Changes:
 ddnsd (2.4.3) stable; urgency=medium
 .
   * refactor: Simplify local variable declaration in sign_handler function
   * refactor: Simplify IP address status check logic in status info
   * refactor: Update output format to include token set and lookup service in status info
   * refactor: Simplify local variable declaration in duck-ddns function
   * refactor: Add shellcheck disable comments for local variable warnings in functions
   * refactor: Improve variable declarations and error handling in Cloudflare DDNS function
   * refactor: Simplify domain and token validation, improve IP address handling
   * refactor: Update EnvironmentFile path in ddnsd.service
   * refactor: Add example email.
   * refactor: Removed CSS styling in README
   * refactor: Center logo and update styling in README, adjust logo height
   * refactor: Remove unnecessary dependencies from control file
   * refactor: Improve readability by quoting variable in ddnsd script and update example domain in config
   * refactor: Update error message to reference configuration file path
   * refactor: Update configuration file path in installation script
   * refactor: Remove old configuration files during installation
   * refactor: Migrate configuration  to INI format  avoiding null/empty values
